{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41642","headline":"谪仙词 · 陈陶","name":"谪仙词","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"牧龙丈人病高秋，羣童击节星汉愁。\n瑶台凤辇不胜恨，太古一声龙白头。\n玉气兰光久摧折，上清鸡犬音书绝。\n蜺旌失手远於天，三岛空云对秋月。\n人间磊磊浮沤客，鸑鷟蜻蜓飞自隔。\n不应冠盖逐黄埃，长梦真君旧恩泽。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈陶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41642.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41642","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}